several high-traffic applications processing millions of daily active users=
.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">My most relevant experience incl=
udes building a real-time trading platform where <strong>microsecond-level =
rendering performance</strong> was critical. We had to optimize React's rec=
