where I extensively worked with <strong>Concurrent Features, Suspense, and =
the new automatic batching</strong>. Additionally, I've contributed to open=
-source libraries like React-Query and have written custom state management=
 solutions using Zustand for complex financial applications.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ex=
cellent background! The trading platform experience is particularly relevan=
