<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key heuristics:</strong>=
</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Two elements of differe=
nt types will produce different trees</strong> - If a <code class=3D"bg-tex=
t-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-=
wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;div&gt;</code> becomes =
