</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ou=
tstanding! Your solutions demonstrate deep understanding of both React inte=
rnals and real-world performance challenges. The operational transform appr=
oach for multi-user sync and the binary search for dynamic heights show you=
 can think algorithmically while maintaining React best practices.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Let me wrap up with one final qu=
estion: Given Meta's scale and the evolution of React, where do you see the=
 biggest opportunities for frontend performance optimization in the next 2-=
3 years?</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Exce=
llent question that gets to the heart of where frontend development is head=
ing! Based on current trends and React's roadmap, I see several key opportu=
nities:</p>
