<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>6. Micro-Frontend Evolut=
ion</strong>
<strong>Module Federation 2.0</strong> and improved micro-frontend patterns=
 could enable <strong>true runtime composition</strong> of applications fro=
m different teams while maintaining performance.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The Meta Advantage:</str=
ong>
